; Kernel theory `Timbda` (coq/*.v).  Logical deps are the pinned Coq libraries of
; tools/pins/pins.toml (CTree, ITree, Coinduction, ExtLib, RelationAlgebra, Stdlib, Paco),
; built by flake.nix's coqStack from the same lockfile — so no (theories ...)/(deps ...)
; field here: with dune's coq lang 0.7 they resolve through rocq's loadpath (ROCQPATH,
; mirrored into COQPATH), which `nix develop .#rocq` sets up.
; Build: nix develop .#rocq && cd coq && dune build.
(coq.theory
 (name Timbda)
 (package timbda-kernel)
)
